{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parkour ninja who roams the night has arrived in a brand-new realm. A completely fresh roguelike setup will make the whole game more tense and thrilling than ever. Are you ready to take on this ever-changing challenge? Enjoy the adrenaline of lightning-fast movement and combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Parkour Assassin: Sprint Run 2!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a legendary parkour adventure: sprint across randomly generated tracks, cut down foes with your blade like a true samurai, vault over obstacles, and keep pushing your distance record ever farther.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We guarantee that every single run will feel different\u2014massive roguelike ingredients include random maps, random buffs, and ever-shifting worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, a huge arsenal of dazzling skills turns the course into a heart-pounding parkour battleground!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064600?t=1762314634","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/3d373df208990820a3b97ba50de7308f61cda49a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762314634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/f7b8cfd5f286425702eea024c7277afcde3aa570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762314634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/f7b8cfd5f286425702eea024c7277afcde3aa570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762314634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parkour ninja who roams the night has arrived in a brand-new realm. A completely fresh roguelike setup will make the whole game more tense and thrillin